::  name       tally fold quad-sum gate
::  shape      quad-shape -> sum - int (@u32)
::  invariant  folds four closed-tuple fields into one @u32; proves emit is N-wide (STOA335)
::  example    1 1 1 1 -> 4 · 0 0 0 0 -> 0
::  readers    Tally · Glow Tend a2 · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-a2-tally-fold4-v0 · STOA335: n past triple (e246)
::
::  Same verb `sum`, wider closed shape — the bound is the allowlist, not a hardcoded 3.
|=  xs=quad-shape
|+  sum  xs
